  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* HomebrewFormula: add linux support by @nicks in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/118\r\n* Vendor bump containerd/docker/runc by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/122\r\n* Force runc 1.0.3 vendoring by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/125\r\n* feat: use -trimpath and buildid= for better reproducible binaries by @developer-guy in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/126\r\n* Use newer lint tools by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/131\r\n* Update client go by @gnadaban in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/130\r\n* Bump vendoring for distribution and containerd by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/127\r\n* Add docs showing how to validate images are loaded by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/132\r\n* Bump vendoring for containerd and runc by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/135\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @nicks made their first contribution in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/118\r\n* @developer-guy made their first contribution in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/126\r\n* @gnadaban made their first contribution in https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/pull/130\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/vmware-tanzu/buildkit-cli-for-kubectl/compare/v0.1.5...v0.1.6",
